# Machine-local Claude settings and editor config. NOT a blanket
# `settings.json` rule: .claude/settings.json is deliberately TRACKED (it
# carries the shared hook configuration), and a blanket rule nominally
# covering a tracked file is a trap for anyone who later runs
# `git rm --cached`.
.claude/settings.local.json
